@model Event
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Home Page";
}

<!-- Introduction section, text appears on top of a background image -->
<div class="background container">
    <section class="invite">
        <h1 class="display-4 emphasis text-warning">We are getting married!</h1>
        <p>We are most delighted to invite you to celebrate this special occasion with us.</p>
        <p><a asp-controller="Event" asp-action="Index">View all details and let us know if you will be able to join us.</a> Kindly RSVP by <time class="fw-bold" datetime="@Model.Date">@Model.Date</time>.</p>
        <p>We truly hope you can be a part of our big day!</p>
    </section>
</div>

<!-- Section for introducing the couple, stands out with a yellow background -->
<section class="standout">
    <div class="container">
        <h2>Who are we then?</h2>
        
        <p>Well, we would like to hope that you know us already if you have managed to find your way here. But in case you don't, we are John and Jane.</p>
        <p>We are very excited to be getting married and even more excited to celebrate with the people who mean the most to us. This website has all the details you need for the big day, including information about the venue, timings and, most importantly, a place to let us know whether you can join us.</p>
        <p>We hope to see you there!</p>
        
        <p class="emphasis">John & Jane</p>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- Section for couples story -->
<section class="story container">
    <h2>Our story in just two paragraphs</h2>

    <p>
        Once upon a time, John and Jane met and began what seemed like a
        perfectly ordinary conversation. Neither of us knew at the time
        that it would lead to years of adventures, laughter, questionable
        decisions and an impressive number of meals shared together. It
        did not take long to discover that we made a pretty good team,
        although we still do not agree on everything, especially when it
        comes to choosing what to watch.
    </p>
    <p>
        Since then, we have built a life full of favourite places, familiar
        routines and memories that mean the world to us. Now we are taking
        the next step and getting married. We could not be happier to
        celebrate with the people who have helped make our story so special,
        and we hope you will join us for the next exciting chapter.
    </p>
</section>

<!-- Website guide section helping the visitors understand the website. -->
<section class="container website-guide">
    <h2>Everything you need to know</h2>
    <p>
        We have put together this website with all the information you
        need for the day. Have a look around, and when you are ready,
        please let us know whether you will be able to join us.
    </p>
    <p>
        Ps, if you ever get lost on the website just scroll down to the
        bottom and be on the look out for the "Home" link in the footer.
    </p>

    <!-- Linking to RSVP -->
    <!-- TODO: Link to RSVP -->
    <a>Complete your RSVP</a>
</section>